        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Clip on Kie\n\nGenerates a short video clip from a one-line shot description. Use it to compare what the same direction produces across providers before committing a template to one. The example is meant to run on a Kie video model.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Shot\" describes a tram crossing an empty city square in rain at night. \"2 Render\" makes a 5-second 16:9 clip at 1080p, with a negative prompt against text and watermarks. \"3 Clip\" shows the video.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a Kie model on \"2 Render\", then rewrite \"1 Shot\" with your own scene and compare the result against another provider."
        },
